                    <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <article class="impact-card">

                            <div class="impact-icon">👨‍👩‍👧</div>

                            <h3>Stronger Families</h3>

                            <p>
                                Encouraging family wellbeing
                                through practical assistance,
                                care and support.
                            </p>

                        </article>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <article class="impact-card">

                            <div class="impact-icon">🌱</div>

                            <h3>Supported Children</h3>

                            <p>
                                Promoting children's development
                                through education and youth
                                support programmes.
                            </p>

                        </article>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <article class="impact-card">

                            <div class="impact-icon">❤️</div>

                            <h3>Healthier Communities</h3>

                            <p>
                                Promoting dignity, healthcare
                                awareness and community-based
                                support.
                            </p>

                        </article>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <article class="impact-card">

                            <div class="impact-icon">📚</div>

                            <h3>Learning Opportunities</h3>

                            <p>
                                Supporting access to educational
